  "notes": "{倹約|けんやく} refers to the practice of being economical and avoiding wasteful spending.\n\nCOMMON COLLOCATIONS:\n- {倹約|けんやく}⟦する→する：00392_suru⟧: to economize, to be frugal\n- {倹約|けんやく}{家|か}: a thrifty person, a penny pincher\n- {倹約|けんやく}⟦を→を：00422_wo⟧⟦{心|こころ}がける→心がける：10015_kokorogakeru⟧: to try to be economical\n- {倹約|けんやく}⟦{生活|せいかつ}→生活：01443_seikatsu⟧: frugal living\n\nRELATED WORDS:\n- ⟦{節約|せつやく}→節約：03302_setsuyaku⟧: similar meaning, more commonly used in daily contexts\n- {倹約|けんやく} has a slightly more old-fashioned or literary nuance",
